	"web_text": "Duchamp and Donati prepared exactly 999 hand-colored foam-rubber breasts for the deluxe edition of the catalogue for the 1947 Surrealism exhibition that Duchamp and André Breton co-curated. Donati later recalled: \"By the end we were fed up, but we got the job done. I remarked that I never thought I would get tired of handling so many breasts, and Marcel said, 'Maybe that's the whole idea.'\"",
	"didactic_label": "Duchamp and Donati prepared exactly 999 hand-colored foam-rubber breasts for the deluxe edition of the catalogue for the 1947 Surrealism exhibition that Duchamp and André Breton co-curated. Donati later recalled: “By the end we were fed up, but we got the job done. I remarked that I never thought I would get tired of handling so many breasts, and Marcel said, ‘Maybe that's the whole idea.'”",
